# The set_facial_action_units skill, on the topic /skill/set_facial_action_units:
# a target configuration for the face, held until changed and reached through
# the face's smoothing.
#
# It sets the same thing as interaction_skills/SetExpression — the face's
# expression — so a client uses one of the two; if both are used, the latest
# takes the face over.

